<title>USA: Sparton Corp Q2 Dec 31 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Sparton Corp Q2 Dec 31 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Mich. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit$4.03		loss$0.15</p>
<p> Net	 profit31,502	     loss1,138</p>
<p> Revs		32,875		   24,415</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  7,818		    7,811</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit$4.02		loss$0.49</p>
<p> Net	 profit31,131	     loss3,807</p>
<p> Revs		66,155		   41,461</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  7,815		    7,811</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Second quarter and six-month net income includes a $31.6-million after-tax gain from the sale of discontinued automotive operations. Without the gain, Sparton said it lost $0.01 a share from continuing operations in the second quarter versus a loss of $0.09, and a loss $0.04 in the most recent six-month period, compared to a loss of $0.28 in 1995.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
